{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53949","headline":"白水洞飞泉 · 裴休","name":"白水洞飞泉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵泉何太高，北斗想可挹。\n淩日五色云，直偪千仞急。\n白虹下饮涧，寒剑倚天立。\n闪电不得瞬，长雷无敢蛰。\n万丈石崖坼，一道林峦湿。\n险偪飞泻坠，冷心山鬼泣。\n须当截海去，浊浪不相入。\n（见乾隆十二年刊张雄图纂《长沙府志》卷四五、光绪《湖南通志》卷四《山川》二。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53949.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53949","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}